deno_signals 0.49.0: give iOS the Darwin signal table.

The signal-name table is per-OS with no fallback, so on iOS
signal_str_to_int() does not exist and deno_os fails to compile.

diff -ruN a/dict.rs b/dict.rs
--- a/dict.rs
+++ b/dict.rs
@@ -145,7 +145,7 @@
   (31, "SIGSYS" | "SIGUNUSED")
 );
 
-#[cfg(target_os = "macos")]
+#[cfg(any(target_os = "macos", target_os = "ios"))]
 signal_dict!(
   (1, "SIGHUP"),
   (2, "SIGINT"),
